remarkable with what speed one learns to

00:03:07.420 --> 00:03:23.230
adopt the prone position January 13th
1916 I long and long to see you to clasp

00:03:23.230 --> 00:03:33.760
you in my arms and I long with all my
heart to see my baby how I love her what

00:03:33.760 --> 00:03:46.959
hopes I have for her what a sweet girl
